WEBVTT

00:11:27.079 --> 00:11:31.204
and executive director of Mars Design
Group, which designs hospitals,

00:11:31.204 --> 00:11:33.496
schools and memorials around the world,

00:11:33.829 --> 00:11:37.662
including the National Memorial for
Peace and Justice in Alabama.

00:11:38.162 --> 00:11:42.912
You can see his full talk at TED
that come on the show today,

00:11:43.246 --> 00:11:46.829
The Power of Spaces Ioannou SHAHMORADI.

00:11:47.079 --> 00:11:50.121
And you're listening to the
TED Radio Hour from NPR.